@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/

### Test connexion
GET http://localhost:3000

### Create account
POST {{baseUrl}}signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "exemple"
}

### Create account : doublon (doit renvoyer 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "autre"
}

### Create account : champ manquant (doit renvoyer 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "sansmotdepasse"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "exemple"
}

### Login : mauvais mot de passe (doit renvoyer 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "test",
    "password": "mauvais"
}

### Login : utilisateur inexistant (doit renvoyer 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "fantome",
    "password": "exemple"
}

### Me sans token (doit renvoyer 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}me

